WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.970
I am the true savior!

00:06.430 --> 00:09.890
Key spirits, come to me!

00:16.340 --> 00:20.880
I'll let you hang on to Amir Gaul
for a little longer.

00:20.880 --> 00:26.180
I'm sure there will be a suitable place
and time for us to settle things.

00:26.860 --> 00:28.550
Noah...

00:41.640 --> 00:49.240
Far away from the town where I was born

00:49.240 --> 00:52.410
I am singing

00:52.410 --> 01:00.060
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:00.060 --> 01:03.320
Away in my pocket

01:03.320 --> 01:08.860
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:08.860 --> 01:13.900
Toward the unknown road

01:13.900 --> 01:19.340
I'll walk

01:19.340 --> 01:24.750
I'll move forward

01:24.750 --> 01:29.580
Not for someone else's sake

01:29.580 --> 01:35.060
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:35.060 --> 01:40.530
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:40.530 --> 01:45.770
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:45.770 --> 01:49.790
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:51.440 --> 01:54.970
I live

02:00.950 --> 02:04.720
Episode 49
Mother and Child

02:09.190 --> 02:14.150
Why do key spirits make people so crazy?

02:15.630 --> 02:17.170
Noah...

02:17.170 --> 02:21.970
Have you fallen under the key spirits' spell,
just like Mom?

02:23.370 --> 02:27.170
We really can't go back to how
we were back then?

02:30.750 --> 02:33.650
You're saying a savior has appeared in Tusk?

02:33.650 --> 02:35.220
It's hard to say for sure,

02:35.220 --> 02:40.190
but I've received a report that an energy of
unprecedented strength has been detected there.

02:40.190 --> 02:44.150
Then, isn't it possible that it's not a savior,
but Tusker himself?!

02:44.730 --> 02:48.860
If Tusker really has resurrected, what do we do?!

02:52.230 --> 02:55.340
I'll personally go confirm what it is.

02:55.340 --> 02:56.960
Zico!

03:02.480 --> 03:04.100
Master Zico!

03:04.810 --> 03:06.580
Roya...

03:06.580 --> 03:07.750
What is it?

03:07.750 --> 03:08.920
Master Zico...

03:08.920 --> 03:14.380
Um, well, I really want to go see Zed!

03:15.960 --> 03:20.590
I can't bear to sit around here
while Zed is in danger!

03:21.060 --> 03:22.690
So...

03:23.670 --> 03:25.600
So...

03:25.600 --> 03:27.570
Want to come with me?

03:29.740 --> 03:31.360
Master Zico!

03:47.590 --> 03:49.560
Who are you?

03:49.560 --> 03:51.130
Noah...

03:51.130 --> 03:53.600
At last, I see you again.

03:53.600 --> 03:55.390
You're...

03:57.170 --> 03:59.130
Oh, no...

04:00.440 --> 04:02.560
You're hurt.

04:06.640 --> 04:08.610
Where is Zed?!

04:09.210 --> 04:12.610
I must defeat him!

04:12.610 --> 04:16.070
He wounded me!

04:17.220 --> 04:19.020
What a fool you are.

04:19.750 --> 04:22.660
It's obvious you don't have what
it takes to beat that boy.

04:22.660 --> 04:23.890
What?!

04:23.890 --> 04:27.560
Zed has been chosen by a key spirit.

04:27.560 --> 04:33.070
Only another chosen key spirit wielder
can defeat him.

04:33.070 --> 04:35.340
You mean Lord Dolga?

04:35.340 --> 04:38.910
Those two are fated to fight one day.

04:38.910 --> 04:42.540
There's no room for you to stick your nose in.

04:45.280 --> 04:47.080
Why, you!

04:51.450 --> 04:54.420
Damn you, Molima!

05:04.970 --> 05:08.470
Roya, you search over there.

05:08.470 --> 05:10.100
Right!

05:17.780 --> 05:20.150
No!

05:20.150 --> 05:21.950
That voice...

05:27.560 --> 05:29.180
Sara!

05:30.160 --> 05:32.630
Zed's mother...

05:35.500 --> 05:39.800
So, you've become so weakened that
you can't even use a spell shard?

05:40.640 --> 05:43.810
If you wield a key spirit when you
aren't qualified for the task,

05:43.810 --> 05:47.080
it eats away at your body.

05:47.080 --> 05:50.110
That's particularly true of you,
who took Amir Gaul into herself.

05:50.110 --> 05:52.410
You're at your limit.

05:53.410 --> 05:55.450
Mind your own business.

05:55.450 --> 05:58.650
I won't let you two get in my way!

05:58.650 --> 06:00.190
What?

06:00.190 --> 06:02.220
Amir Gaul...

06:02.220 --> 06:04.930
He's mine.

06:04.930 --> 06:06.390
Give it up, Sara!

06:06.390 --> 06:09.960
If you go after Amir Gaul any more, it will kill...

06:09.960 --> 06:11.590
Roya!

06:13.770 --> 06:15.400
Zed!

06:15.770 --> 06:18.240
You too, old man?!
What the hell are you doing here?!

06:23.040 --> 06:24.670
Mom...

06:27.120 --> 06:28.740
Mom!

06:31.950 --> 06:33.580
Mom...

06:36.560 --> 06:42.360
It's my fault Sara is that way.

06:50.510 --> 06:53.410
Noah, you've changed.

06:53.410 --> 06:55.710
How muscular you've become!

06:56.640 --> 07:00.600
But the essence of you hasn't changed a bit.

07:02.150 --> 07:04.120
I can tell.

07:04.890 --> 07:07.860
I didn't think you were alive.

07:09.360 --> 07:11.480
What did you come here for?

07:17.870 --> 07:19.800
I see...

07:19.800 --> 07:23.600
The powerful energy that Templar detected

07:23.600 --> 07:27.740
must have been from the
girl Mirred's awakening, then.

07:27.740 --> 07:32.200
Yeah, but Mirred couldn't become Tusker.

07:34.050 --> 07:39.620
And you say Noah now has all the
key spirits but Amir Gaul?

07:39.620 --> 07:41.590
Yeah...

07:41.590 --> 07:45.390
Is Noah trying to become the savior?

07:46.230 --> 07:48.300
He's changed.

07:48.300 --> 07:51.600
The key spirits have changed him.

07:51.600 --> 07:55.740
But I'll never let him have Amir Gaul!

07:55.740 --> 07:57.860
Never, I swear it.

08:01.610 --> 08:03.240
Zed...

08:03.680 --> 08:06.610
About your mom...

08:06.610 --> 08:08.080
My mom?

08:08.080 --> 08:10.150
She looked painfully skinny, you know?

08:10.150 --> 08:13.950
Master Zico says it's because she's
been captivated by Amir Gaul.

08:14.560 --> 08:18.860
He said he didn't think she'd survive
taking Amir Gaul in again.

08:23.230 --> 08:26.530
She still wants Amir Gaul when he'll kill her?

08:27.500 --> 08:30.540
Maybe it's too late for her to go back to normal.

08:30.540 --> 08:32.340
You can't give up!

08:34.010 --> 08:39.910
My mother kept watching over me even
when she was just a spirit!

08:39.910 --> 08:43.720
I'm sure your mother cares about you too!

08:43.720 --> 08:45.350
So...

08:48.590 --> 08:50.220
Mom!

08:54.030 --> 08:55.830
I'll be back!

08:56.300 --> 08:58.070
Zed, wait!

08:58.070 --> 09:00.030
Wait there for me!

09:14.950 --> 09:16.950
Please, Mom...

09:16.950 --> 09:19.580
Give up on Amir Gaul!

09:22.720 --> 09:24.230
You know, right?!

09:24.230 --> 09:26.160
You know that next time you take him inside you...

09:26.160 --> 09:29.460
How old are you, again?

09:30.160 --> 09:35.470
What a terrible mother I am,
forgetting a thing like that.

09:36.640 --> 09:38.260
Mom?

09:38.970 --> 09:41.380
You must be hungry.

09:41.380 --> 09:45.330
I can't make you anything good
in a place like this, but...

09:51.050 --> 09:54.060
What do you want with me this late in the game?

09:54.060 --> 09:58.430
I believed in your fate,

09:58.430 --> 10:01.400
that you were the one who'd become the savior.

10:02.200 --> 10:06.070
But fate is something that shifts with time.

10:06.070 --> 10:09.970
There are two large stars shining in the sky now.

10:09.970 --> 10:12.470
Two?

10:12.470 --> 10:15.810
Your star, and one more.

10:15.810 --> 10:19.940
I can no longer tell which of you
will become the savior.

10:20.310 --> 10:26.620
All I know is that you need me.

10:26.820 --> 10:29.060
Two?!

10:29.060 --> 10:33.160
I have to see your story through to the end,

10:33.160 --> 10:38.030
because that's my responsibility as the
one who led you to this world.

10:38.030 --> 10:39.830
Shut up!

10:41.100 --> 10:45.730
I am no longer the man you once knew!

10:47.910 --> 10:49.540
Noah...

10:55.820 --> 10:59.620
It's so strange, Mom cooking for me...

11:01.890 --> 11:03.360
It will be ready soon.

11:03.360 --> 11:05.830
O..Okay...

11:08.260 --> 11:12.220
Can the two of us start over?

11:14.870 --> 11:16.500
Just a little longer...

11:16.500 --> 11:18.510
Huh? Okay...

11:18.510 --> 11:21.410
Yes, just a little longer...

11:21.410 --> 11:23.410
I'm almost there...

11:23.410 --> 11:25.880
Just wait...

11:27.580 --> 11:28.650
Mom?

11:28.650 --> 11:30.620
It's just about done.

11:33.390 --> 11:35.690
Almost done!

11:41.160 --> 11:44.290
When this is done, he's mine!

11:48.640 --> 11:51.760
Amir Gaul will be mine!

11:53.370 --> 11:57.330
My precious one...

12:03.650 --> 12:05.280
Mom...

12:12.090 --> 12:14.930
Dear, Great Tusker...

12:14.930 --> 12:18.890
I offer myself to you, body and soul.

12:19.700 --> 12:22.940
Please, hurry and destroy this boring world,

12:22.940 --> 12:26.070
and create your world!

12:34.850 --> 12:36.820
It's ready.

12:40.020 --> 12:42.990
Here, eat it before it gets cold.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.430
What's wrong? Eat up.

12:51.330 --> 12:54.130
You want him bad enough to
do something like this?

12:55.470 --> 12:58.100
You'd even kill your own son?!

13:00.940 --> 13:06.210
I told you, if you take in Amir Gaul again,
you'll die!

13:06.210 --> 13:08.820
And you know it too, don't you?!

13:08.820 --> 13:10.610
I don't care.

13:12.190 --> 13:14.690
I don't care if I die!

13:14.690 --> 13:16.820
What I want is Amir Gaul!

13:16.820 --> 13:18.960
That's all!

13:18.960 --> 13:22.800
If I can get that rapture, that ecstasy...

13:22.800 --> 13:24.920
I'll give my life!

13:26.800 --> 13:28.600
How stupid...

13:29.540 --> 13:31.660
How freaking stupid!

13:34.610 --> 13:36.240
Amir Gaul!

13:37.410 --> 13:40.710
My precious Amir Gaul!

13:41.980 --> 13:45.440
Hurry, please, give me Amir Gaul!

13:57.400 --> 13:59.700
He's finally come back to me!

14:00.600 --> 14:03.900
My dear, dear Amir Gaul!

14:15.880 --> 14:19.010
Mine at last...

14:19.950 --> 14:22.090
Stop, Sara!

14:22.090 --> 14:26.890
Roya, leave this to me and go find Zed.

14:27.430 --> 14:29.060
Right!

14:30.030 --> 14:31.900
Zico...

14:31.900 --> 14:35.170
Sara, you must give back Amir Gaul!

14:35.170 --> 14:36.540
Shut up!

14:36.540 --> 14:39.610
I won't let you give me any more speeches,

14:39.610 --> 14:44.410
because Amir Gaul is mine!

14:49.920 --> 14:51.710
I have no choice!

14:52.350 --> 14:53.980
Fyron!

15:24.080 --> 15:27.380
Zed! Zed!

15:28.660 --> 15:30.760
Why?!

15:30.760 --> 15:33.560
Why did you give her Amir Gaul?!

15:34.330 --> 15:35.900
Shut up.

15:35.900 --> 15:38.570
What the hell? Your mom will die!

15:38.570 --> 15:39.770
Don't you get that?!

15:39.770 --> 15:40.600
Shut your mouth!

15:40.600 --> 15:41.900
No, I won't !
Shut your mouth!

15:42.340 --> 15:45.110
My mom is dead,

15:45.110 --> 15:47.210
even if I want to see her, I can't !

15:47.210 --> 15:50.340
But your mom is alive, Zed!

15:51.810 --> 15:54.850
As long as she lives, don't give up.

15:54.850 --> 15:58.480
Don't give up on living together,
however you can!

16:01.490 --> 16:03.120
Mom...

16:10.730 --> 16:12.530
Who is it?!

16:13.100 --> 16:14.870
I found you at last, boy.

16:14.870 --> 16:16.870
I'm so glad.

16:16.870 --> 16:18.540
Dukeham!

16:18.540 --> 16:20.840
You bastard, you're alive?!

16:24.910 --> 16:29.540
This wound you gave me will never heal.

16:30.150 --> 16:32.820
This wound is humiliation itself...

16:32.820 --> 16:35.290
The pain of my soul!

16:35.820 --> 16:38.790
Now, draw your sword, Zed!

16:39.960 --> 16:43.500
Roya, you go on ahead to where Mom is.

16:43.500 --> 16:44.600
Zed...

16:44.600 --> 16:46.570
Please.

16:46.570 --> 16:48.190
Okay!

16:50.400 --> 16:52.700
Zed!

16:58.150 --> 16:59.770
Fyron...

17:30.110 --> 17:32.410
What power!

17:34.350 --> 17:35.720
This is it!

17:35.720 --> 17:39.590
This is the power of my beloved Amir Gaul!

17:39.590 --> 17:42.560
This is what I was seeking!

17:46.830 --> 17:48.800
Amir Gaul...

17:59.370 --> 18:00.770
What?

18:00.770 --> 18:02.570
What is this?

18:09.150 --> 18:10.350
Sara!

18:10.350 --> 18:11.980
Master Zico!

18:13.150 --> 18:17.280
I'm fine, but Sara is...

18:19.960 --> 18:21.590
Sara...

18:27.500 --> 18:31.300
On my pride as a Tuskan soldier...

18:49.090 --> 18:53.160
Savior or not,

18:53.160 --> 18:58.460
if my last opponent is you...

19:02.900 --> 19:04.530
Mom!

19:05.240 --> 19:07.540
Sara, stay with us!

19:08.610 --> 19:10.240
Sara!

19:16.120 --> 19:18.740
Just a little longer...

19:19.890 --> 19:22.090
With this power...

19:22.090 --> 19:24.390
If I just have this power...

19:26.090 --> 19:27.890
I'll...

19:32.200 --> 19:34.300
Now, everything will come back to me!

19:34.300 --> 19:38.260
I can protect everything that's precious to me!

19:46.450 --> 19:48.150
Protect?

19:48.150 --> 19:50.280
Everything that's precious to me?

19:51.650 --> 19:54.050
I can't remember...

19:54.050 --> 19:56.850
What is this?

20:06.300 --> 20:09.100
What warm light...

20:39.500 --> 20:41.300
I remember now.

20:42.900 --> 20:47.570
Back then, the one who eased my suffering...

20:47.570 --> 20:50.870
The one who saved me from despair...

20:54.920 --> 20:56.950
I wanted to protect you.

20:56.950 --> 20:59.420
I wanted to become strong!

21:04.390 --> 21:07.560
Why did I forget him for so long?

21:07.560 --> 21:09.930
My precious...

21:09.930 --> 21:11.730
Zed...

21:16.170 --> 21:18.970
Sara, stay with us!

21:24.140 --> 21:25.940
What is it?

21:31.550 --> 21:33.850
I'll tell him, I promise.

21:41.700 --> 21:42.860
Sara! Sara!
Sara!

21:42.860 --> 21:44.490
Sara! Sara!

21:46.430 --> 21:47.670
Sara!

21:47.670 --> 21:49.300
Sara...

22:08.660 --> 22:12.110
Your mother asked me to tell you something.

22:14.290 --> 22:16.920
My precious Zed,

22:18.000 --> 22:19.800
thank you.

22:26.510 --> 22:28.300
Mom...

22:39.620 --> 22:42.020
I just wanted to get away

22:42.020 --> 22:44.920
From that troublesome place

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
And flap my wings

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
How many times have I scolded myself

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
For still being so immature?

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
I'll just move with all I've got

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Towards that promised place

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Ours are true wings

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Of very, very beautiful feathers

23:24.000 --> 23:26.700
So we won't succumb

23:26.700 --> 23:33.740
To even the greatest, most intense gust of wind

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
We must fly far, far away with all we've got

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
See, now we're one with the wind

23:49.560 --> 23:54.630
And we can look back and laugh at those days

23:54.630 --> 23:57.930
We choked back so many tears

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
All the way to the ends of the world

24:18.020 --> 24:20.950
Next time, "An Eternal Bond"

24:18.790 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
An Eternal Bond
